---
title: "borrow_flash_loan (flash_loan.move)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_version: app.ensure_version_matches()
    q_version --> q_validate_market: app.validate_market(market)
    q_validate_market --> q_check_permission: app.ensure_has_permission(cap_id, flash_loan())
    q_check_permission --> q_call_inner: borrow_flash_loan_inner(market, amount, emode_group, ctx)
    q_call_inner --> [*]: return (coin, flash_loan)

    note right of q_version
        INV-001: Version must match current protocol version before any operation
    end note

    note right of q_check_permission
        INV-002: Caller must hold PackageCallerCap with flash_loan permission
        INV-003: Permission check uses object::id(cap), binding capability to identity
    end note

    note right of q_call_inner
        INV-004: Returned FlashLoan is a hot potato that must be consumed by repay_flash_loan
    end note
